  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds the SqlServer store provider (OpenIddict.EntityFrameworkCore, runtime-only) and the bring-your-own-identity SessionBridge option (configuring SessionBridge:AuthenticationSchemes now enables the endpoint automatically). Firebase login, the Firebase token-exchange grant, and the Firebase helper services (IFirebaseTokenVerifier, IFirebaseUserAdmin, IAuthTestUserProvisioner) are now gated on Firebase.Enabled — apps that ran OAuth with Firebase disabled must set Firebase:Enabled=true to keep them. MongoStoreOptions was renamed to StoreOptions (an obsolete alias is kept). Existing OAuth+Firebase configurations are unaffected.",
